# A line (motion review: lines.strips, tests/posecontinuity.test.ts): ollie onto the ledge into an FS
# Crooked Grind (up + toward, the ledge on the right, held as it locks on), pop out with a kickflip.
park lab
cmd 0 teleport 0 1.1 0.14 90
hold up 6..100
hold ollie 90..105
hold up 170..182
hold right 170..182
tap grind 176
hold ollie 230..250
tap flip+left 254
bot balance
run 420
expect event grindStart{trick=FS Crooked Grind} within 170..190
expect event pop within 249..253
expect event trickEnd{trick=Kickflip} within 280..320
expect no event bail
